{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_title", "source_sha256": "0c2f061e2694a08c11a77cd8a100b81fb75794cb56bcbbe1adcfb26b0977ba05", "ja": "あずさと舞台裏", "zh": "梓与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8654dcb85a33e4351f9129d5b5eb57d609b3d618b959bc73cdae331f7633251b", "ja": "あずさとの舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与梓在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1000_402cpr", "source_sha256": "d8aaf108c0f43ca0f001ccb583cba1b7b70f94d78cb7274e75025a16d5391092", "ja": "あずささん、今日はすみませんでした。\n突然、合同レッスンの進行をお願いしてしまって……。", "zh": "梓小姐，今天真是不好意思。\n突然拜托你负责合练的流程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "e4031e733ef049576aea41aaa923f99c907fae49646359b9a8a424075297b4f6", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ♪　みんな、しっかりしてますから。\n困ったことがあっても、ちゃんと話し合って……。", "zh": "没关系的♪　大家都很靠得住。\n遇到难处的时候，也都有好好商量……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "3cd26ec9cafb3f605265c81b3cc0242c0d915b6dd05a515bc2625504f77d57d0", "ja": "それより、プロデューサーさんは大丈夫でしたか？\n最近、いつにも増してお忙しそうですけれど……。", "zh": "比起这个，制作人先生您还好吗？\n最近好像比平时还要忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "a4c19cfec890af1a9414e77bcae01ff0cb8c511c4129d697f8fd157f63b01ed9", "ja": "ああ、すみません。肩書きが変わったせいか、どうも\n慣れない仕事が増えて……っと、これは言い訳ですね。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。可能是因为职务变了，不知怎么的，\n增加了许多不熟悉的工作……呃，这算是借口吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1004_402cpr", "source_sha256": "f1871196ec910427da54012d203987190c355b82ef8ff042132d39769020c6fe", "ja": "もう今日みたいに、あずささんやみんなに\n迷惑かけないよう、気を付けます。", "zh": "我以后会注意，不再像今天这样\n给大家和梓小姐添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "7a901ecfaaab478c71d6a55392339e2212e94e787477d51d16625f47a3b08dca", "ja": "迷惑だなんて……。私、今日は頼ってもらえて、\nとっても嬉しかったんです。", "zh": "别说什么添麻烦了……今天能被大家依靠，我真的特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "d86dd5732d8b4d05a5f0c1a4ac199faee23c1b7c2eb93745705f667179551133", "ja": "アイドルとして、765プロの一員として。\n私だって、もっと役に立ちたいんですから。", "zh": "作为偶像，作为765事务所的一员。  \n我也想更加派上用场嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "4f127cd44ddcb3e93295518b7613fb8840755dd65485913a15a96a3837861458", "ja": "……はい。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "……好的。非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "ba5167e59feb98fa231f047e1df81879956e4765a77640886b92d961ef850598", "ja": "ですから、これからも遠慮しないで、\nどしどし私たちを頼ってくださいね♪", "zh": "所以今后也不要客气，尽管来依靠我们吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_010azu_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_010azu_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "dfbd9475d459b13013ed99b93ea8b3392313aa27d1a23c8d59561ef72f7abaff", "ja": "夢はみんなで叶えたほうが、きっと素敵ですから。\n……ふふっ♪", "zh": "因为大家一起去实现梦想，一定会更美好的。\n……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
